ins:goci a skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/nmsc/scheme/instrument> ;
    skos:prefLabel "GOCI"@en ;
    skos:prefLabel "COMS 해양탑재체"@ko ;
    skos:definition "천리안위성 1호(COMS)에 실린 해양탑재체로, 가시·근적외 채널로 바다 색을 관측해 클로로필·부유퇴적물 같은 바닷물 성분과 에어로졸을 보는 정지궤도 해색 영상기."@ko ;
    skos:definition "Ocean payload on COMS: a geostationary imager of sea colour whose visible and near-infrared channels are used to see what the water contains, such as chlorophyll and suspended sediment, as well as aerosol."@en ;
