    skos:scopeNote "OSCAR satellite-instruments[].wigos-subcomponent 의 wigos-classification 수준. GK 탑재체에 쓰인 값만 포함하며 WIGOS 분류 전체를 복제하지 않는다."@ko , "The wigos-classification level of OSCAR satellite-instruments[].wigos-subcomponent. Only values used for GK payloads are included; the whole WIGOS classification is not copied."@en .

