var:cloud_ice_total_column a skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/nmsc/scheme/variable> ;
    skos:prefLabel "Cloud ice Total Column"@en , "구름 빙정 기주량"@ko ;
    skos:definition "강수 여부와 관계없이 대기 기둥 전체의 고체(얼음) 상태 물을 적분한 양의 2차원 분포."@ko ;
    skos:definition "Two-dimensional field of the column-integrated amount of solid-phase (ice) atmospheric water, whether precipitating or not."@en ;
    skos:broader var:d-cloud ;
    nmsc:isECV false ;
    nmsc:oscarRawValue "Cloud ice Total Column" ;
    skos:exactMatch <https://space.oscar.wmo.int/variables/view/cloud_ice_total_column> ;
    dct:source <https://space.oscar.wmo.int/variables/view/cloud_ice_total_column> ;
    skos:closeMatch <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P07/current/BBAD2158/> ;
    skos:editorialNote "CF closeMatch(atmosphere_mass_content_of_cloud_ice): OSCAR는 강수 여부와 무관한 고체수 전체 기주량(g m-2)"@ko ;
    skos:broadMatch <https://gcmd.earthdata.nasa.gov/kms/concept/05ac9d3e-bc44-41fa-ace0-c41bf3ebee97> ;
    skos:editorialNote "GCMD broadMatch(EARTH SCIENCE > ATMOSPHERE > CLOUDS > CLOUD MICROPHYSICS > CLOUD LIQUID WATER/ICE): GCMD 키워드는 액체·빙정을 함께 묶는다"@ko ;
    dct:source "CF Standard Name Table v95 (2026-09-16) / NVS P07, 2026-11-11 수집·IRI 확인. OSCAR 변수 정의·측정 단위와 대조"@ko ;
    dct:source "NASA GCMD Keywords 25.2 (rev 2026-11-10), 2026-11-11 수집·IRI·라벨 확인"@ko ;
    nmsc:inclusionBasis "gk2a-product" ;
    skos:scopeNote "GK 탑재체의 OSCAR 측정 평가표에는 없지만 GK-2A 확실 산출물이 값을 내는 변수라서 v0.6 에 추가했다. 산출물 근거로 들어온 변수이므로 nmsc:ObservingCapability 가 없다. 어느 산출물인지는 nmsc:estimatesVariable 의 역방향으로 찾는다. OSCAR 변수 237개 전체를 복제하지 않는다."@ko , "Not in the OSCAR measurement evaluation table of the GK payloads, but added in v0.6 because a confirmed GK-2A product produces values for it. Because the variable was added on product evidence, it has no nmsc:ObservingCapability. Which product it comes from is found through the inverse of nmsc:estimatesVariable. The full set of 237 OSCAR variables is not copied."@en .

