    dct:source "NASA GCMD Keywords 25.2 (rev 2026-11-10), 2026-11-11 수집·IRI·라벨 확인"@ko ;
    nmsc:inclusionBasis "gk2a-product" ;
    skos:scopeNote "GK 탑재체의 OSCAR 측정 평가표에는 없지만 GK-2A 확실 산출물이 값을 내는 변수라서 v0.6 에 추가했다. 산출물 근거로 들어온 변수이므로 nmsc:ObservingCapability 가 없다. 어느 산출물인지는 nmsc:estimatesVariable 의 역방향으로 찾는다. OSCAR 변수 237개 전체를 복제하지 않는다."@ko , "Not in the OSCAR measurement evaluation table of the GK payloads, but added in v0.6 because a confirmed GK-2A product produces values for it. Because the variable was added on product evidence, it has no nmsc:ObservingCapability. Which product it comes from is found through the inverse of nmsc:estimatesVariable. The full set of 237 OSCAR variables is not copied."@en .

