    skos:closeMatch <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P07/current/CFSN0619/> ;
    skos:editorialNote "CF closeMatch(equivalent_thickness_at_stp_of_atmosphere_ozone_content): OSCAR는 돕슨 단위. SatWright GK-2A TCO 계약도 이 이름을 쓴다"@ko ;
    skos:closeMatch <https://gcmd.earthdata.nasa.gov/kms/concept/b9107ec3-c777-4e71-9046-55bd7ed57ef0> ;
