prcat:ocean a skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/nmsc/scheme/product-category> ;
    skos:topConceptOf <https://w3id.org/nmsc/scheme/product-category> ;
    skos:prefLabel "해양"@ko , "Oceans"@en ;
    skos:definition "값이 매겨지는 대상이 바다인 산출물의 물리 대상 그룹 — 수온과 그 변동, 해양 열용량, 순환·해류·전선·용승·소용돌이, 해기차, 선박 착빙 위험."@ko ;
    skos:definition "Physical-target group of products whose values describe the sea — water temperature and its variability, ocean heat content, circulation, currents, fronts, upwelling and eddies, the air–sea temperature difference and the risk of vessel icing."@en ;
    skos:editorialNote "정의 초안 확신도 medium(src/definitions.tsv, status 107) — C-11 Claude 초안(2026-11-18), 실음 — 사용자 결정 10e(2026-11-18 \"생성기도 넓혀\", status 142)"@ko ;
    skos:scopeNote "수온(관측·합성·다중위성·변동 지수)·열용량·태풍 해양 열역학, 순환·전선·용승·에디·해류, 해기차, 선박착빙 등급. 변수 영역 var:d-ocean"@ko , "Sea temperature (observed, composite, multi-satellite, variability index), heat content and typhoon ocean thermodynamics, circulation, fronts, upwelling, eddies and currents, air-sea temperature difference, ship icing grade. Variable domain var:d-ocean"@en ;
    skos:broadMatch <https://gcmd.earthdata.nasa.gov/kms/concept/91697b7d-8f2b-4954-850e-61d5f61c867d> ;
