prcat:land-surface a skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/nmsc/scheme/product-category> ;
    skos:topConceptOf <https://w3id.org/nmsc/scheme/product-category> ;
    skos:prefLabel "지표면"@ko , "Land surface"@en ;
    skos:definition "값이 매겨지는 대상이 육지 표면인 산출물의 물리 대상 그룹 — 지표의 온도·방출률·반사도·알베도와 지표에서 타는 산불(화점·방사열·위험도)."@ko ;
    skos:definition "Physical-target group of products whose values describe the land surface — its temperature, emissivity, reflectance and albedo — and wildfires burning on it (hot spots, radiative power and danger)."@en ;
    skos:editorialNote "정의 초안 확신도 medium(src/definitions.tsv, status 107) — C-11 Claude 초안(2026-11-18), 실음 — 사용자 결정 10e(2026-11-18 \"생성기도 넓혀\", status 142)"@ko ;
    skos:scopeNote "지표면 온도·방출률·반사도·알베도·양방향반사율분포, 산불(화점 탐지·방사열·위험도). 산불은 현상 축 값이다. 변수 영역 var:d-land·var:d-radiation(알베도·BRDF)·var:d-fire"@ko , "Land surface temperature, emissivity, reflectance, albedo, bidirectional reflectance distribution; wildfire (hot spot detection, radiative power, danger). Wildfire is a value of the phenomenon axis. Variable domains var:d-land, var:d-radiation (albedo, BRDF), var:d-fire"@en ;
    skos:broadMatch <https://gcmd.earthdata.nasa.gov/kms/concept/6a426480-c58f-4b6b-8e35-0975b7f6edb5> ;
