prod:cloud-top-temperature a skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/nmsc/scheme/product> ;
    skos:topConceptOf <https://w3id.org/nmsc/scheme/product> ;
    skos:prefLabel "운정온도"@ko ;
    skos:definition "구름 꼭대기의 온도. 구름이 여러 층이면 가장 높은 구름의 꼭대기다. 천리안위성 2A호(GK-2A) AMI 관측으로 추정한다."@ko ;
    skos:definition "Temperature of the cloud top (of the highest cloud when several layers are present), estimated from GK-2A AMI observations."@en ;
    skos:altLabel "Cloud Top Temperature"@en ;
    skos:altLabel "CTT"@en ;
    nmsc:productGroup prgr:sg-cloud-top-properties ;
    nmsc:productCategory prcat:cloud ;
    nmsc:operationalAlgorithm "GK2A_CTPS" ;
    nmsc:operationalAlgorithm "GK2A_pre_CTPS" ;
    nmsc:producedByAlgorithm alg:gk2a-ctps ;
    nmsc:producedByAlgorithm alg:gk2a-pre-ctps ;
    nmsc:generationMethod genm:retrieved ;
    nmsc:temporalRelation trel:observation ;
    nmsc:operationalL1BInput ins:ami ;
    nmsc:operationalInput prod:cloud-detection ;
    nmsc:operationalInput prod:rttov-clear-sky-simulation ;
    nmsc:operationalInput prod:daytime-cloud-optical-thickness ;
    nmsc:operationalInputEvidence "알고리즘 입력 노드(nmsc:AlgorithmInput)에서 뽑은 단축 경로 — 역할 primary·intermediate, 자기 자신 제외(status 98): GK2A_CTPS ← l1b:ami(primary)·prod:cloud-detection(intermediate)·prod:rttov-clear-sky-simulation(intermediate)·prod:daytime-cloud-optical-thickness(intermediate); GK2A_pre_CTPS ← l1b:ami(primary)·prod:cloud-detection(intermediate). 외부 입력(extin:)은 단축 경로에 싣지 않는다. 보조·정적·보정 입력과 외부 입력은 노드에 있다 — src/product_inputs.tsv"@ko ;
    nmsc:satelliteObservationBased true ;
    nmsc:estimatesVariable var:cloud_top_temperature ;
    nmsc:variableEvidence "Cloud top temperature ← GK2A_CTPS → gk2a-ctps 출력 CTT (K); gk2a-pre-ctps 는 air_temperature_at_cloud_top"@ko ;
    nmsc:processingLevel plev:l2 ;
    nmsc:processingLevelEvidence "L2 ← GK2A_CTPS → L2/CTPS (GK2A_AUX_Mod_Write_L2.f90:3910); GK2A_pre_CTPS → L2/pre_CTPS (GK2A_AUX_Mod_Write_L2.f90:3590)"@ko ;
    nmsc:derivedFromInstrument ins:ami ;
    nmsc:instrumentEvidence "AMI ← GK2A_CTPS ← AMI L1B (run_gk2a_ctps.sh:22); GK2A_pre_CTPS ← AMI L1B (run_gk2a_pre_ctps.sh:27)"@ko ;
    dcat:spatialResolutionInMeters "2000"^^xsd:decimal ;
    nmsc:coverageNote "공간 해상도·산출 주기(src/product_resolution.tsv): FD·ELA 둘 다 2 km(같은 CTPS 파일). 산출 주기 미확인(status 150) — 드라이버 보폭 6시간(시험값)(run_gk2a_ctps.sh:96,101,106)는 재처리·시험 드라이버 값(algorepo run_gk2a_*.sh 는 time=etime=202404010000 꼴) — 운영 crontab 이 algorepo 에 없음, 운영 주기는 NMSC 확인(satWright 답 2026-11-19; docs/questionnaire-r3.md 2-18)"@ko ;
    dct:source "공간 해상도·산출 주기 근거: 명세 gk2a-ctps-spec-2026-10-26.md:1 'GK2A_CTPS (cloud top phase/temperature/pressure/height, FD/ELA 2 km, L2)' — satwright-content-gk2a@280975ea(2026-11-18 읽음) — 사실표 = docs/science/gk2a-product-facts-2026-11-15.tsv 그 산출물 행, 명세 = docs/science/{파일}:{행}(NMSC 운영 코드를 읽은 재구현 명세). 2026-11-19 satWright 답(운영 코드 file:line)으로 고친 행은 근거에 따로 적었다(status 150) — src/product_resolution.tsv"@ko ;
    nmsc:disseminatedVia dism:uhrit ;
    nmsc:disseminationEvidence "초고속 정보 전송 ← Fact sheet 7 표 7-1 UHRIT/LDUS 'cloud top temperature/pressure/height' — 문구 일치(운정온도)"@ko ;
