    dct:source "NMSC GK-2A AMI ATBD 국문판 「에어로졸 광학두께 및 에어로졸 입자 크기(Aerosol Optical Depth and Ångström Exponent Product)」 Version 1.0(2019. 04. 25) 표지 — https://nmsc.kma.go.kr/resources/common/pdf/외GK2A_L2_ATBD_국문_에어로졸광학특성_AOD-AEP.pdf (2026-11-16 열람)"@ko .

