    skos:definition "Fields written as 'GDAPS' (gdaps_*_gk2a) in the fact table: boundary layer height, SRH, ALH. GDAPS is the name of a KMA global forecast system; whether it is the same lineage as the UM global fields was not confirmed, so it is kept apart."@en ;
