# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 13. SPDX 3.0.1 재사용 선언 (복제하지 않고 참조한다)
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------

<https://w3id.org/nmsc/> a owl:Ontology ;
    owl:imports <https://spdx.org/rdf/3.0.1/> ;
    rdfs:comment "소프트웨어 축은 SPDX 3.0.1 을 그대로 쓴다. 이 어휘는 software:Package 나 software:SoftwarePurpose 를 다시 정의하지 않는다. 용도는 SPDX 의 SoftwarePurpose 열거값(operatingSystem, library, framework, module, firmware, deviceDriver, container, configuration 등)을, 의존 관계는 core:Relationship 과 RelationshipType(dependsOn, contains, hasDynamicLink, hasStaticLink, hasPrerequisite 등)을, 식별자는 ExternalIdentifierType(packageUrl, cpe23, swid, swhid, gitoid, cve)을 쓴다. 2026-11-11 에 spdx.org/rdf/3.0.1/spdx-model.ttl 에서 직접 확인했다."@ko , "The software axis uses SPDX 3.0.1 as is. This vocabulary does not redefine software:Package or software:SoftwarePurpose. For purpose it uses the SPDX SoftwarePurpose enumeration values (operatingSystem, library, framework, module, firmware, deviceDriver, container, configuration and so on), for dependencies core:Relationship and RelationshipType (dependsOn, contains, hasDynamicLink, hasStaticLink, hasPrerequisite and so on), and for identifiers ExternalIdentifierType (packageUrl, cpe23, swid, swhid, gitoid, cve). Checked directly in spdx.org/rdf/3.0.1/spdx-model.ttl on 2026-11-11."@en .

